---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Social tariffs in Hull" description="Cheaper broadband and mobile plans for people on benefits in Hull: KCOM Full Fibre Flex, O2, SMARTY and VOXI social tariffs, free SIMs, and a checker to see what you could get.">

  <section class="st-hero" aria-labelledby="stf-h">
    <div class="ah-in">
      <p class="ah-eyebrow">Get online for less</p>
      <h1 id="stf-h">Social tariffs in Hull</h1>
      <p class="lead">If you get Universal Credit, Pension Credit or certain other benefits, you can get home broadband from £14.99 a month and mobile plans from £10 a month. There are no long contracts, and you can usually leave at any time.</p>
      <ul class="st-facts">
        <li><b>£14.99</b><span>a month for KCOM full fibre broadband</span></li>
        <li><b>£10</b><span>a month for a mobile plan with unlimited calls</span></li>
        <li><b>70%</b><span>of eligible households don't know social tariffs exist</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ah-sec" aria-labelledby="chk-h">
    <div class="ah-in">
      <div class="st-check">
        <div>
          <h2 id="chk-h">Check what you could get</h2>
          <p>Tick any benefits someone in your home gets. We'll show the deals you may qualify for.</p>
          <div class="checks st-ben" id="st-ben">
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="uc"> Universal Credit</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="pc"> Pension Credit</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="jsa"> Jobseeker's Allowance</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="esa"> Employment and Support Allowance</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="is"> Income Support</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="hb"> Housing Benefit</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="pip"> Personal Independence Payment</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="dla"> Disability Living Allowance</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="aa"> Attendance Allowance</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="care"> Care leaver</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="st-res" aria-live="polite">
          <p class="st-res-h" id="st-res-h">Tick a benefit to see your options</p>
          <ul id="st-res"></ul>
          <p class="st-res-n">Rules can include extra conditions, such as income-based JSA or ESA. The provider makes the final check.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ah-sec alt" aria-labelledby="bb-h">
    <div class="ah-in">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="ah-eyebrow">Home broadband</p>
        <h2 id="bb-h">KCOM Flex: Hull's broadband social tariff</h2>
        <p>KCOM runs most of Hull's full fibre network. Its Flex packages are for households on benefits and run month to month.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ops st-ops">
        <article class="op">
          <div class="oh"><h3>Full Fibre Flex</h3><span class="tag yes">Broadband</span></div>
          <div class="tariff"><span class="price">£14.99<small> / month</small></span>
          <dl class="spec"><dt>Speed</dt><dd>30Mbps</dd><dt>Contract</dt><dd>30-day rolling</dd><dt>Good for</dt><dd>Browsing, email, video calls and streaming on one or two devices</dd></dl></div>
        </article>
        <article class="op">
          <div class="oh"><h3>Full Fibre Flex Plus</h3><span class="tag yes">Broadband</span></div>
          <div class="tariff"><span class="price">£19.99<small> / month</small></span>
          <dl class="spec"><dt>Speed</dt><dd>50Mbps</dd><dt>Contract</dt><dd>30-day rolling</dd><dt>Good for</dt><dd>Families with several people online, homework and HD streaming</dd></dl></div>
        </article>
        <article class="op">
          <div class="oh"><h3>Voice only Flex</h3><span class="tag no">Landline</span></div>
          <div class="tariff"><span class="price">£5.10<small> / month</small></span>
          <dl class="spec"><dt>Includes</dt><dd>750 minutes a month to landlines and mobiles</dd><dt>Contract</dt><dd>30-day rolling</dd><dt>Good for</dt><dd>Keeping a home phone without broadband</dd></dl></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="st-how">
        <div>
          <h3>Who qualifies</h3>
          <p>The bill payer must get Universal Credit (with zero or reduced earnings), Pension Credit, Income Support, Jobseeker's Allowance, income-related ESA, Housing Benefit, PIP, Attendance Allowance or DLA. Care leavers and care home residents referred by social services also qualify.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>How to apply</h3>
          <p>Apply online at <a href="https://www.kcom.com/home/packages/flex/" rel="noopener">kcom.com/flex</a>. You can confirm your benefits through Open Banking for a decision in minutes, or upload proof and wait about two working days. You can also call KCOM on <b>01482 602555</b>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="st-note">Your home may also be reached by another full fibre network. If it is, other providers' social tariffs may be available too. Check every provider on <a href="https://www.ofcom.org.uk/phones-and-broadband/saving-money/social-tariffs" rel="noopener">Ofcom's social tariffs list</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ah-sec" aria-labelledby="mob-h">
    <div class="ah-in">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="ah-eyebrow">Mobile</p>
        <h2 id="mob-h">Mobile social tariffs</h2>
        <p>For many people a phone is the main way online. Three networks offer cheap plans for people on benefits. EE doesn't currently have one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ops st-ops">
        <article class="op">
          <div class="oh"><h3>O2 Essential Plan</h3><span class="tag yes">O2</span></div>
          <div class="tariff"><span class="price">£10<small> / month</small></span>
          <dl class="spec"><dt>Data</dt><dd>10GB</dd><dt>Calls &amp; texts</dt><dd>Unlimited</dd><dt>Contract</dt><dd>30-day rolling, no price rises</dd><dt>Who qualifies</dt><dd>Universal Credit, Pension Credit (Guarantee Credit), Income Support, income-based JSA or ESA</dd></dl>
          <p class="apply">Call O2 on <b>0344 809 0202</b> or use live chat at <a href="https://www.o2.co.uk/essential-plan" rel="noopener">o2.co.uk</a>.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="op">
          <div class="oh"><h3>SMARTY Social Tariff</h3><span class="tag yes">Three network</span></div>
          <div class="tariff"><span class="price">£12<small> / month</small></span>
          <dl class="spec"><dt>Data</dt><dd>Unlimited, 5G included</dd><dt>Calls &amp; texts</dt><dd>Unlimited</dd><dt>Contract</dt><dd>1-month rolling, no credit check</dd><dt>Who qualifies</dt><dd>People on eligible benefits</dd></dl>
          <p class="apply">Apply at <a href="https://smarty.co.uk/social-tariff" rel="noopener">smarty.co.uk/social-tariff</a>.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="op">
          <div class="oh"><h3>VOXI For Now</h3><span class="tag yes">Vodafone network</span></div>
          <div class="tariff"><span class="price">£10<small> / month</small></span>
          <dl class="spec"><dt>Data</dt><dd>Unlimited for 6 months, then VOXI's standard £10 plan</dd><dt>Calls &amp; texts</dt><dd>Unlimited</dd><dt>Contract</dt><dd>Change, pause or cancel any time</dd><dt>Who qualifies</dt><dd>Universal Credit, JSA, ESA, PIP or disability benefits</dd></dl>
          <p class="apply">Apply at <a href="https://www.voxi.co.uk/for-now" rel="noopener">voxi.co.uk/for-now</a>.</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="st-note">Signal indoors varies a lot across Hull by network. Before you switch, check your postcode on <a href="https://www.ofcom.org.uk/mobile-coverage-checker" rel="noopener">Ofcom's mobile coverage checker</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ah-sec alt" aria-labelledby="free-h">
    <div class="ah-in st-free">
      <div>
        <p class="ah-eyebrow">No benefits needed</p>
        <h2 id="free-h">Free SIMs and data from the National Databank</h2>
        <p>If you're on a low income and can't afford to get online, you can get free mobile data, calls and texts for up to 12 months. You don't need to be on benefits.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><b>O2:</b> 25GB data plus UK calls and texts for 30 days</li>
          <li><b>VodafoneThree:</b> 40GB data plus calls and texts for 30 days, renewing for 6 months</li>
          <li>For adults aged 18 and over</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="st-cta">
        <h3>Where to get one</h3>
        <p>West Hull Community Hub on North Road gives out free SIMs. Other local hubs can refer you.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-p" href="/#hubs">Find a hub near you</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ah-sec" aria-labelledby="tips-h">
    <div class="ah-in">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2 id="tips-h">Before you switch</h2></div>
      <ol class="st-steps">
        <li><b>Check you qualify</b><span>Use the checker above, or ask the provider.</span></li>
        <li><b>Have proof ready</b><span>Your National Insurance number or a recent benefit letter.</span></li>
        <li><b>Ask your current provider first</b><span>You may be able to move to its social tariff without changing your router or SIM.</span></li>
        <li><b>Compare with normal deals</b><span>Ordinary SIM-only deals are sometimes cheaper than social tariffs, so compare both.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="helpline">
        <div><h3>Need help applying?</h3><p>Our hubs can help you check what you qualify for and fill in the application with you.</p></div>
        <a class="btn btn-p" href="/contact/">Ask us for help</a>
      </div>
      <p class="st-note">Prices and eligibility were checked in October 2026 and can change. Always confirm with the provider before you sign up.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script slot="scripts" is:inline src="/js/social-tariffs.js"></script>
</Base>
